    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Xenofauna</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Echo IV</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 4–20</p><p>These cute, omnivorous, winged avian-primates live in a symbiotic relationship with Echolalian land anemones.They are playful and prone to pranks, but they also lead explorers to the hungry and deadly anemone tentacles.</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Small Size (−10 to hit)</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Chameleon Skin, Enhanced Hearing, Enhanced Smell, Grip Pads, Prehensile Feet, Prehensile Tail</p><p><strong>Immunity:</strong> Clown sprites are immune to land anemone venom.</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 7 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 4, Death Rating 30.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 156.</em></p>",
